.TH SDL_GetPixelFormatFromGPUTextureFormat 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetPixelFormatFromGPUTextureFormat \- Get the SDL pixel format corresponding to a GPU texture format.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_gpu.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_PixelFormat SDL_GetPixelFormatFromGPUTextureFormat(SDL_GPUTextureFormat format);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I format
a texture format\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the corresponding pixel format, or
.BR SDL_PIXELFORMAT_UNKNOWN
if there is no corresponding pixel format\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

